tion and music for entering the spirit of Halloween<br></li><li> 3 difficulty modes from single color relaxed playing to real challenges with color switching (up to 6 colors)<br></li><li> 140 color-coded nonograms, 20 bonus nonograms + 20 additional puzzles<br></li><li> A gorgeous virtual tour around the globe, showing the spookiest places in the world<br></li><li> Enigmatic semi-abstract images to be disclosed on each level<br></li><li> A heap of fun and a good deal of edutainment information</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1174320/extras/a77b4fab3d2f7830e15977cb3e900f70.avif?t=1696321994\" /></div></h2><br><strong>Come and play our latest VR game! </strong>",
